   "reviews": [
    {
     "name": "Kimberly",
     "date": "2026-10-04",
     "rating": 4,
     "text": "The place was very much as expected and described. There was a little bit more of a rustic, feeling in spots that we were expecting, but it met our needs, everybody had a bed and clean sheets, and the kitchen is very easy to utilize, well labeled. The location was perfect for our needs.",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Karen",
     "date": "2026-10-11",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "Comfortable beds, very spacious, nice to have coffee provided. Manuel was extremely responsive.",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Karrah",
     "date": "2026-10-18",
     "rating": 4,
     "text": "Thank you for helping us figure out little issues.",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Jason",
     "date": "2026-09-25",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "Great place to stay.  The host is always responsive.",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Winea",
     "date": "2026-06-22",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "We had a great stay overall. The home was exactly as described, clean, comfortable, and well-maintained. The host was friendly, responsive, and quick to answer any questions we had throughout our stay. The only minor issue was that some of the cooking/eating utensils had stains on them, but I was able to clean them before use without any problem. Aside from that, everything was wonderful. The house was amazing, and the host made the experience enjoyable. I would definitely stay here again and recommend this property to others.",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Jason",
     "date": "2026-09-18",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "Great place to stay. Owner is great to work with.",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Jason",
     "date": "2026-09-10",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "Great place to stay. The host is very helpful and responsive. Would highly recommend to anyone.",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Gina",
     "date": "2026-09-20",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "Nico Villa was spacious and clean and a quick 20 drive to Fayetteville for the game. We had everything we needed. In cooler weather we would have enjoyed the outdoor space! And we felt good participating in the charitable work supported by our host ❤️",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Michele",
     "date": "2026-06-14",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "Such a wonderful, kind host who was quick to respond and willing to help how he could!",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Andrew",
     "date": "2026-05-25",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "The home was far better than I could’ve ever hoped. My prior reservation had scheduling issues so I had to pivot and find a spot last minute to be a backup. As soon as I booked Manuel was messaging me within five minutes. I was able to be fully checked in and unpacked in an hour from my other reservation being canceled.  The home is very open and large. Great for hosting a big family. Not a single amenity is missed from the ping pong table to the smart home speaker. Will be the only place I ever book when I’m in town to visit family.",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Matthew",
     "date": "2026-06-06",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "Courteous host, continuously checked in to see if anything was needed. Clean house. Everything was in order.",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Jose Eusebio",
     "date": "2026-05-19",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "Me and my now wife got married at sasphros. Vineyard, it's about 14 minute drive from this property. Check-in was easy. Whose was super friendly. im definitely booking it again at next time i'm out here.",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Oliver",
     "date": "2026-05-16",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "My family and I had such a wonderful time staying here! It’s a fantastic spot, conveniently located near where our daughter graduated from Springdale High School, and also close to our family and friends’ homes. We had a blast chatting and playing ping pong, and the place is huge enough for our family to have a big dinner. I really enjoyed talking with families and friends outside the house, where there’s a little outdoor furniture set for hanging out. We absolutely love this place; it feels like home. We’re planning to come back very soon, and we will!",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Paula",
     "date": "2026-05-10",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "What a beautiful and super clean place to stay. Everything we needed was there. We look forward to staying again if we’re ever in town! Thank you so much.",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Kim",
     "date": "2026-05-09",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "Perfect house for large group.",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Christopher",
     "date": "2026-04-30",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "Friendly host. Would stay again.",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Dorothy",
     "date": "2026-04-26",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "This was a great space for our family! Boys on one end, girls on the other, us in the middle. The kitchen was lovely, and we all enjoyed the open floor plan, ping pong table, and free wifi. Hit up Mirabella’s for brunch for a great experience and La Sirenita for authentic El Salvadoran pupusas with the family.",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Guadalupe",
     "date": "2026-04-25",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "Always responds within minutes and the house was super clean. Very friendly and nice, beautiful house and all the rooms are spacious. The house is beautiful!",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Tanner",
     "date": "2024-11-03",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "We had a great stay! 20 min from the football stadium and 20 min from Dickson! The ping pong table was a hit and having TVs in the upstairs rooms was super nice. The layout of the airbnb is perfect for big groups. We will definitely be booking this house again!!!",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Daniel",
     "date": "2024-10-06",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "Manuel was very attentive and responsive to questions we had on check in and during our stay. We had issues with the Wi-Fi, and Manuel was on top of getting it connected for us. There is plenty of room and the place is clean and comfortable. We had to take our daughter to breakfast in the morning, so we missed out on his offer to bring breakfast.  I would definitely stay at Manuels place the next time we are in Fayetteville.",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Aimee",
     "date": "2024-10-10",
     "rating": 4,
     "text": "The place was roomy, clean, and very nice! Overall, we enjoyed our overnight stay. The home was beautiful, and the Nicaraguan breakfast was a wonderful touch! A warning to future guests, there was no Internet access during quiet hours, therefore the televisions and tablet didn’t work during that time.",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Brenda",
     "date": "2024-10-05",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "Clean, spacious comfortable. Great host friendly staff. Nice breakfast provided. Drawers and cabinets well labeled. I’d not hesitate to stay there again.",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Elmer",
     "date": "2024-09-06",
     "rating": 5,
     "text": "I had an amazing stay at Manuel. The place was spotless, stylish, and had everything ! needed. The location was perfect.",
     "lang": "en"
    },
    {
     "name": "Olivia",
     "date": "2024-09-30",
